Suturable DuraGen Dural Regeneration Matrix;
Non-Pyrogenic;
Sterility guaranteed unless package is damaged or opened. Rx only.
Manufacturer: Integra LifeSciences Corporation, Plainsboro, NJ 08536

Suturable DuraGen is an absorbable implant for repair of dural defects. It is indicated as a dural substitute for the repair of dura matter.
